{"id":14633,"date":"2017-03-08T00:00:00","date_gmt":"2017-03-08T07:00:00","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.rethinkfirst.com\/resources\/join-our-march-webinar-board-certified-autism-technician-bcat-an-efficient-and-affordable-certification-path-for-front-line-staff\/"},"modified":"2024-07-05T16:46:23","modified_gmt":"2024-07-05T22:46:23","slug":"bcat-efficient-affordable-certification-path-front-line-staff","status":"publish","type":"resources","link":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/resources\/bcat-efficient-affordable-certification-path-front-line-staff\/","title":{"rendered":"BCAT: Efficient and Affordable Certification Path for Front-line Staff"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>RethinkBH invites you to take part in our upcoming webinar, <strong>Board Certified Autism Technician (BCAT): An Efficient and Affordable Certification Path for Front-line Staff!<\/strong><\/p>\n<p>The BCAT offers a path for front-line staff to be certified in as little as one week.<\/p>\n<p>Available on-demand, thousands of health care providers and behavior technicians have immediate access to the <strong>first and only autism-specific certification exam accredited by the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.credentialingexcellence.org\/Accreditation\/Earn-Accreditation\/NCCA\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">National Commission for Certifying Agencies (NCCA)<\/a>.<\/strong><\/p>\n<p><a href=\"https:\/\/behavioralcertification.org\/about-us-autism-spectrum-disorder\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignright wp-image-13153 size-full\" src=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/BICC-1.png\" alt=\"Behavioral Intervention Certification Council\" width=\"218\" height=\"218\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/BICC-1.png 218w, https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2017\/03\/BICC-1-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 218px) 100vw, 218px\" \/><\/a><\/p>\n<p>This webinar will take place on Thursday, March 16th at 1pm ET\/10am PT and will feature <a href=\"https:\/\/www.linkedin.com\/in\/lauren-rivera-a7858b66\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Lauren Rivera Whitlock<\/a>,\u00a0Executive Director of the Behavioral Intervention Certification Council, as a guest presenter.<\/p>\n<p>This targeted set of presentations will focus on the business aspects of running an ABA provider group.<\/p>\n<p>Whether you are just getting started, or in high growth mode, this series will offer insights and best practices for helping your business succeed.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":19,"featured_media":19363,"template":"","meta":{"_seopress_robots_primary_cat":"","_seopress_titles_title":"Webinar: BCAT Efficient, Affordable Front-line Staff Certification","_seopress_titles_desc":"Whether you're an ABA provider just getting started or in high growth mode, this series will offer insights & best practices for helping your business succeed.","_seopress_robots_index":"","om_disable_all_campaigns":false,"_links_to":"","_links_to_target":""},"audience":[70],"resource-type":[72],"resource-topic":[327,97,329,69],"resource-tag":[336,137,308,223],"class_list":["post-14633","resources","type-resources","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","audience-providers","resource-type-webinar","resource-topic-aba","resource-topic-autism","resource-topic-behavior","resource-topic-business","resource-tag-asd","resource-tag-certification","resource-tag-health-plans","resource-tag-healthcare"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources\/14633","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/resources"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/resources"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.rethinkbehavioralhealth.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/19"}],"version-